    "text": "11. KALENDAS OCTOBRIS. NATALE SANCTI MATHEI APOSTOLI ET EUANGELIST\u00c6. Se\nCum transiret iesus. uidit hominem in thelonio sedentem. matheus nomine; ET RELIGUA; \u00dea \u00f0a se\nMatheus aras \u00fe\u00e6rrihte fram his tolle. and filigde \u00f0am h\u00e6lende. and gela\u00f0ode hine \u00fe\u00e6s d\u00e6ges. to his\nEfne \u00f0a comon fela gerefan. and synfulle men. and s\u00e6ton \u00e6t \u00f0am gereorde mid \u00feam h\u00e6lende and his\nHw\u00e6t \u00f0a. \u00fea iudeiscan sunderhalgan and boceras \u00fe\u00e6t gesawon and mid ceorunge cw\u00e6don to cristes\nHw\u00e6t la. hwi gereorda\u00f0 eower lareow hine mid \u00f0isum manfullum mannum and synfullum? \u00f0a\nNis nan neod \u00feam strangum nanes l\u00e6ces. ac \u00f0am \u00f0e yfele sind geh\u00e6fde;\nFara\u00f0 nu and leornia\u00f0 hw\u00e6t \u00f0is m\u00e6ne. Ic wylle mildheortnysse. and na offrunge;\nNe com ic na to clipigenne \u00f0a rihtwisan. ac \u00f0a synfullan to d\u00e6dbote;\nWe nima\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t andgit \u00feises godspelles \u00e6g\u00f0er ge of mathees gesetnysse ge of lucas;\nMatheus is ebreisc nama \u00fe\u00e6t is on leden donatus. and on englisc forgifen o\u00f0\u00f0e gegodod;\nGod hine godode. swa \u00fe\u00e6t he hine awende of tollere to apostole. and him forgeaf \u00f0a gife \u00fe\u00e6t he\nHe hine geseah sittan \u00e6t tolle. he hine geseah. na \u00fe\u00e6t an mid lichamlicere gesih\u00f0e. ac eac swilce\nFolga me na \u00fe\u00e6t an on fotlicum gange. ac eac swilce on goddra \u00f0eawa geefenl\u00e6cunge. swa swa se\nMatheus aras and forlet his tollscire. and filigde criste. for \u00f0an \u00f0e he mid ungesewenlicere\nMatheus \u00fea gearcode micel gereord \u00f0am h\u00e6lende. and hine to his huse gela\u00f0ode;\nHe gearcode him gebeorscipe on his huse. ac he gearcode him micele \u00feancwur\u00f0ran gereord on his\nGod afanda\u00f0 \u00e6lces mannes heortan. and se \u00f0e underfeh\u00f0 his neosunge mid godum willan se bi\u00f0\n\u00dea sunderhalgan